[{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其六","author":"倪谦","text":"又逐鸣鸠到耳傍，青春背我去堂堂。\n谷风自昔歌葑菲，泾渭相形益可伤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其七","author":"倪谦","text":"偏讶愁随一线长，肯同桃李竞新妆。\n此心非石安能转，自保坚贞比卫姜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其八","author":"倪谦","text":"一刻千金孰与偿，瑶琴无复凤求凰。\n妾心有似池中藕，虽断柔丝绾更长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其九","author":"倪谦","text":"已甘抱节比枯篁，曾荐青奴一夜凉。\n就使秋风能再热，敢辞辛苦侍帏房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"于景瞻以闺情和予梦中之作少寓热中之意因效颦以复十首 其十","author":"倪谦","text":"只愁金剪割离肠，恩宠难凭苦不常。\n已愧短檠墙角弃，何时游鲽海东洋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青山白云图","author":"倪谦","text":"苍苍万壑暝云浮，谁伴深林鹿豕游。\n眼底乡山故无恙，一帆孤负五湖舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹭丝画","author":"倪谦","text":"白雪毵毵好羽衣，藕花洲渚恣鸣飞。\n自缘肌骨生来瘦，岂是鱼虾不疗饥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其一","author":"倪谦","text":"柳絮飞时雪作团，乱人心绪正漫漫。\n侍儿呼取添衾褥，道是轻盈不禦寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其二","author":"倪谦","text":"默倚雕阑数雁行，双眉蹙破远山苍。\n不如后院閒消遣，去送秋千唤女郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其三","author":"倪谦","text":"远道回车未肯膏，为图名利逐儿曹。\n归期望断门空掩，坐对梨花月影高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其四","author":"倪谦","text":"片片飞花逐水流，园林绿暗不胜愁。\n断肠无计留春住，人老东风燕子楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其五","author":"倪谦","text":"凤帏抛却绮罗香，一别天涯有底忙。\n几阵黄梅窗外雨，飘潇润浥藕丝裳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其六","author":"倪谦","text":"白汗凝珠拭素巾，垄头麦熟又尝新。\n锁窗倦绣停针线，蛱蝶飞来最恼人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其七","author":"倪谦","text":"柳岸凉风透葛蕉，心旌愁绝正摇摇。\n兰舟去后知何处，新水空添没断桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其八","author":"倪谦","text":"破愁曾借步兵厨，一枕浑忘醉梦馀。\n鹦鹉无端却饶舌，鬓云低挽独踌躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其九","author":"倪谦","text":"远寄寒衣手自缝，泠泠凉雨滴疏桐。\n孤灯相伴坐来久，不觉忽闻山寺钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其十","author":"倪谦","text":"高柳清秋咽露螀，声声应是怨凄凉。\n妾怀敢向何人诉，只祷虚空爇夜香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其十一","author":"倪谦","text":"散步苔阶晚饭馀，月华如昼列星疏。\n碧天多少南征雁，若个能传万里书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":40777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵董廷器闺情 其十二","author":"倪谦","text":"昔赏黄花到夕阳，奉君欢饮罄壶觞。\n如今九日人何在